@startuml
title Type-2 exchange - PLANNED / NOT EXECUTED
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFD
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #2563EB
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F3F4F6

actor "Policy authority" as Auth
participant "Node-Agent A" as A
database "Separate fence /\nexport journals" as J
database "OVN NB / SB" as DB
participant "GoBGP A" as G
participant "FRR Remote1" as F
participant "Remote1 Linux\nbridge / VXLAN" as R
participant "Owned local\nNetlink sync" as K
participant "ovn-controller /\nOVS forwarding" as O

Auth -> A : scoped exact endpoint policy
A -> J : persist revision / digest / generation
A -> DB : complete NB / SB reads
DB --> A : exact ready locally bound LSP
A -> A : intersect authorization and observation
A -> J : export journal: durable AddPath intent
A -> G : AddPath Type-2
G --> A : acknowledged UUID
A -> J : commit exact UUID receipt
G -> F : local Type-2 / RT / VNI / next hop A
F -> R : install received endpoint FDB / neighbor
F -> G : external Type-2 / next hop R1
A -> G : complete RIB reads
G --> A : two equal validated observations
A -> K : receipt-owned remote FDB / neighbor
K --> O : Netlink observation
O -> O : program OVS VXLAN / flows
O -[#16A34A]> R : local endpoint to external endpoint
R -[#16A34A]> O : return VXLAN / VNI 1000

note over G,R
  BGP processes do not forward workload packets.
  Linux sync UDP60100 and actual OVS UDP4789 are separate.
end note
note over A,O
  Dependencies are asynchronous, not one atomic transaction.
  Importer receipts are independent of authorization/export journals.
end note
@enduml
